# Trivy vulnerability ignore list
# Format: CVE-ID [expiration] # reason
#
# Each entry here has been reviewed and accepted. Document:
#   - Which package introduces it
#   - Why it cannot be fixed upstream
#   - Why the risk is acceptable in this project

# CVE-2022-42969: ReDoS in py.path.svnwc (py 1.11.0)
# Introduced by: interrogate (dev-only dependency for docstring coverage checks)
# Upstream status: py is abandoned; no fix version available
# Risk: py.path.svnwc is only reachable when traversing SVN working-copy paths.
#        This project does not use SVN. The vulnerable code path is never exercised.
#        Dev-dependency only — not present in production builds.
CVE-2022-42969
